(6888294, 1038120, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup. This image doesn''t have a story behind it, which to me makes it a bit less interesting, but nicely done overall.</td>', 'Nicely setup. This image doesn''t have a story behind it, which to me makes it a bit less interesting, but nicely done overall.', '2012-10-22 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
