(6888322, 1038186, 114225, '<td valign="top">Just barely there, but the reflections add a nice accent.<br/> <br/>I like how the espresso is coming out as a double shot :)</td>', 'Just barely there, but the reflections add a nice accent. I like how the espresso is coming out as a double shot :)', '2012-10-22 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
