(6888329, 1038067, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of complimentary colors.<br/> <br/>Took me a minute to figure out why this shot worked when others (which are very similar) that I took didn''t. It''s all about the complimentary colors.</td>', 'Nice use of complimentary colors. Took me a minute to figure out why this shot worked when others (which are very similar) that I took didn''t. It''s all about the complimentary colors.', '2012-10-22 11:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
