(6888609, 1038483, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. Nice idea and execution. I feel though that something just didn''t quite click to take this from a cool shot to a spectacular one.  I can''t quite put my finger on it. Some ideas: perhaps stronger reflection (less movement in the water?), eyes open with some emotion, tighter crop, it could be any number of things. :)</td>', 'This is really cool. Nice idea and execution. I feel though that something just didn''t quite click to take this from a cool shot to a spectacular one.  I can''t quite put my finger on it. Some ideas: perhaps stronger reflection (less movement in the water?), eyes open with some emotion, tighter crop, it could be any number of things. :)', '2012-10-22 17:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888612, 1038207, 47316, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of cool what you have going on here with the shadows and reflections. I think though with the grain and colors it comes off looking like a cell phone pic. I also don''t think the setting is very interesting. At the least, I would have cropped out the bed as it adds nothing to the shot.</td>', 'It''s kind of cool what you have going on here with the shadows and reflections. I think though with the grain and colors it comes off looking like a cell phone pic. I also don''t think the setting is very interesting. At the least, I would have cropped out the bed as it adds nothing to the shot.', '2012-10-22 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888615, 1038496, 47316, '<td valign="top">Seems the blacks are pushed too hard and lost all detail. Not much here in the way of a focal point...</td>', 'Seems the blacks are pushed too hard and lost all detail. Not much here in the way of a focal point...', '2012-10-22 17:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
