(6889063, 1038108, 93171, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but the colors/lighting seem a little flat to me.  Beautiful reflection, though.  Like a mirror.</td>', 'I like this photo, but the colors/lighting seem a little flat to me.  Beautiful reflection, though.  Like a mirror.', '2012-10-23 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889066, 1038068, 93171, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this one a 5.  It''s a little bit boring to me.  The trees are a little bit dark for my taste, and it''s lacking "pop" or something more interesting than the group of trees.  Great job capturing the reflection, though!  (I made a vow to myself to comment on more photos and not just my faves.  I wish people would do that for me so I could improve.)</td>', 'I''m giving this one a 5.  It''s a little bit boring to me.  The trees are a little bit dark for my taste, and it''s lacking "pop" or something more interesting than the group of trees.  Great job capturing the reflection, though!  (I made a vow to myself to comment on more photos and not just my faves.  I wish people would do that for me so I could improve.)', '2012-10-23 15:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889067, 1037935, 93171, '<td valign="top">I originally rated this a 5, but the more I look at it, I think it deserves a 6.  It''s a little bit dark for my taste, but I absolutely love the composition.</td>', 'I originally rated this a 5, but the more I look at it, I think it deserves a 6.  It''s a little bit dark for my taste, but I absolutely love the composition.', '2012-10-23 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889072, 1038370, 93171, '<td valign="top">I like your subject.  It''s an interesting piece that''s refreshing after seeing so many water photos in this challenge.  Something about it seems snapshot-like to me, though.  Maybe next time you could try to get it at a different angle?  Or see how it looks in b/w?  (I made a vow to myself to comment on more photos and not just my faves.  I wish people would do that for me so I could improve.)</td>', 'I like your subject.  It''s an interesting piece that''s refreshing after seeing so many water photos in this challenge.  Something about it seems snapshot-like to me, though.  Maybe next time you could try to get it at a different angle?  Or see how it looks in b/w?  (I made a vow to myself to comment on more photos and not just my faves.  I wish people would do that for me so I could improve.)', '2012-10-23 15:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889074, 1037933, 93171, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  I love the composition and the shallow depth of field.  And your little model here is so cute!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  I love the composition and the shallow depth of field.  And your little model here is so cute!', '2012-10-23 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
