(6889083, 1038407, 93171, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 7.  It''s one of my favorites in the challenge.  It probably would''ve been my fave if not for one thing.  The white part at the bottom of the goose''s neck blends in a tad too much with the water, and unless I look closely, it looks to me like the head is separate from the body.  BUT, now that I typed all that, I noticed your title and realized you probably already knew that!  Beautiful photo, though!  You should get that one framed.</td>', 'I gave this one a 7.  It''s one of my favorites in the challenge.  It probably would''ve been my fave if not for one thing.  The white part at the bottom of the goose''s neck blends in a tad too much with the water, and unless I look closely, it looks to me like the head is separate from the body.  BUT, now that I typed all that, I noticed your title and realized you probably already knew that!  Beautiful photo, though!  You should get that one framed.', '2012-10-23 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
