(6890008, 1038371, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image really has me looking, trying to figure out the setting and the subject. It''s a very nice abstract, and B&amp;W was a great choice.</td>', 'This image really has me looking, trying to figure out the setting and the subject. It''s a very nice abstract, and B&W was a great choice.', '2012-10-24 11:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
