(6890022, 1037895, 47316, '<td valign="top">The colors and reflection are cool. I think something looks a little off to me though... like perhaps it was out of focus and then sharpened to compensate.</td>', 'The colors and reflection are cool. I think something looks a little off to me though... like perhaps it was out of focus and then sharpened to compensate.', '2012-10-24 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890026, 1038177, 47316, '<td valign="top">Kind of an interesting black and white. I think the title does it no justice. It''s confusing. The shot isn''t about you, it''s about that subject. We don''t need to know that it was taken before your tanning session...</td>', 'Kind of an interesting black and white. I think the title does it no justice. It''s confusing. The shot isn''t about you, it''s about that subject. We don''t need to know that it was taken before your tanning session...', '2012-10-24 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890028, 1037933, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy. I''d like to see this in black and white, the colors are pretty bland.</td>', 'Cute little guy. I''d like to see this in black and white, the colors are pretty bland.', '2012-10-24 11:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890029, 1038152, 47316, '<td valign="top">Yes! I really like this. Been feeling pretty lackluster about DPC. This helps. :D</td>', 'Yes! I really like this. Been feeling pretty lackluster about DPC. This helps. :D', '2012-10-24 11:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890056, 1038393, 114225, '<td valign="top">There are some nice geometric shapes here, but overall this photo doesn''t interest me much.</td>', 'There are some nice geometric shapes here, but overall this photo doesn''t interest me much.', '2012-10-24 12:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890058, 1038167, 114225, '<td valign="top">The return of wine glass shots! :)<br/> <br/>I like the depth of the image with the multiple glasses in view.</td>', 'The return of wine glass shots! :) I like the depth of the image with the multiple glasses in view.', '2012-10-24 12:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890059, 1038032, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan on many eye close up photos, including this one unfortunately. I''m seeing a lot of artifacts from over sharpening.</td>', 'I''m not a fan on many eye close up photos, including this one unfortunately. I''m seeing a lot of artifacts from over sharpening.', '2012-10-24 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890060, 1037822, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting thought to this photo. I think it could have been more powerful if cropped tighter so the wall and the non-reflective part of the door was not visible.</td>', 'Interesting thought to this photo. I think it could have been more powerful if cropped tighter so the wall and the non-reflective part of the door was not visible.', '2012-10-24 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890061, 1038059, 114225, '<td valign="top">A pretty standard puddle shot. The B&amp;W conversion is good, and the lines a nice.</td>', 'A pretty standard puddle shot. The B&W conversion is good, and the lines a nice.', '2012-10-24 12:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890062, 1038112, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting how this looks a bit like an eye into another dimension.</td>', 'Interesting how this looks a bit like an eye into another dimension.', '2012-10-24 12:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890063, 1038439, 114225, '<td valign="top">Second time I have looked at this, and I''m still not sure what I''m looking at.<br/> <br/>A decent abstract.</td>', 'Second time I have looked at this, and I''m still not sure what I''m looking at. A decent abstract.', '2012-10-24 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
