(6890065, 1038466, 114225, '<td valign="top">I too enjoy when cars start to get covered in falling leaves. Normally I don''t look to the reflections in the paint job, which is interesting (but a bit dark here).</td>', 'I too enjoy when cars start to get covered in falling leaves. Normally I don''t look to the reflections in the paint job, which is interesting (but a bit dark here).', '2012-10-24 12:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
