(6890080, 1037895, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny how the reflection looks squished. This photo is lacking the sharpness that I think it would need to succeed.</td>', 'Funny how the reflection looks squished. This photo is lacking the sharpness that I think it would need to succeed.', '2012-10-24 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
