(6890746, 1038483, 138630, '<td valign="top">Tones and model are beautiful.</td>', 'Tones and model are beautiful.', '2012-10-25 10:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890747, 1038016, 138630, '<td valign="top">Loved this on my first pass through.  Wish the bright container in the upper left was not there but otherwise I think this is splendid.  I''m sure I''ll be back to bump.</td>', 'Loved this on my first pass through.  Wish the bright container in the upper left was not there but otherwise I think this is splendid.  I''m sure I''ll be back to bump.', '2012-10-25 10:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890749, 1038237, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The hoar frost on the reeds is stunning.  What I wish is that the reflection was lighter and brighter - it''s really over-powered by the plant.  For a Reflection challenge, I''d like to see said reflection star.  Voted earlier.<br/>Looking at this on my husband''s monitor - balance is much better than I thought.  Bumping.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The hoar frost on the reeds is stunning.  What I wish is that the reflection was lighter and brighter - it''s really over-powered by the plant.  For a Reflection challenge, I''d like to see said reflection star.  Voted earlier.Looking at this on my husband''s monitor - balance is much better than I thought.  Bumping.', '2012-10-25 10:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890750, 1038445, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such glorious fall color - almost as fresh looking in the reflection as in the scene which is amazing.  Love that his jersey is blue - complementary colors work so well.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Such glorious fall color - almost as fresh looking in the reflection as in the scene which is amazing.  Love that his jersey is blue - complementary colors work so well.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890752, 1038466, 138630, '<td valign="top">Been trying to figure this one out - leaves on a very thin sheet of ice perhaps?  Quite lovely and the composition is very nice, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Been trying to figure this one out - leaves on a very thin sheet of ice perhaps?  Quite lovely and the composition is very nice, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890753, 1038389, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice - I like that you have included only the reflection and then inverted it for this Impressionistic painting result.  I think the slight torn paper look for the edge works well here, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Very nice - I like that you have included only the reflection and then inverted it for this Impressionistic painting result.  I think the slight torn paper look for the edge works well here, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890754, 1038114, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love that tiny violin in the bottle - how ever did you get it in there?<br/>:)<br/>The rich, warm tones are nice, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love that tiny violin in the bottle - how ever did you get it in there?:)The rich, warm tones are nice, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890755, 1037668, 138630, '<td valign="top">I have to say the reality and the reflection merge wonderfully here thanks to the clarity and rich colors of the reflection.  Love that single duck.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I have to say the reality and the reflection merge wonderfully here thanks to the clarity and rich colors of the reflection.  Love that single duck.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890758, 1038004, 138630, '<td valign="top">I always admire the skill that goes into shots like this.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I always admire the skill that goes into shots like this.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 10:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890777, 1038177, 153814, '<td valign="top">Very busy image oh and I can see you.<br/>It kept my interest, it works for me very nice.</td>', 'Very busy image oh and I can see you.It kept my interest, it works for me very nice.', '2012-10-25 11:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890780, 1038432, 138630, '<td valign="top">A little dark for me - vignette?? - but nice clarity and I love the blue and white.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'A little dark for me - vignette?? - but nice clarity and I love the blue and white.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 11:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
