(6890928, 1038160, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject but the image feels crowded and not very well planned.  Needs more space at the top, for example, and I don''t think the railing at the bottom or, for that matter, the round bit of wall on the left add anyting positive.  Plus I would like to see the subject (not the reflection) in focus.  I do like the tones and as I said I think this is a subject with great potential, I just don''t think it''s realized.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Very interesting subject but the image feels crowded and not very well planned.  Needs more space at the top, for example, and I don''t think the railing at the bottom or, for that matter, the round bit of wall on the left add anyting positive.  Plus I would like to see the subject (not the reflection) in focus.  I do like the tones and as I said I think this is a subject with great potential, I just don''t think it''s realized.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890931, 1038396, 138630, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful but the reflections are not strong enough for me.  Wonder what you could have done had you tried to capture the autumn leaves reflected in that blue-green table top . . . <br/>Voted earlier.</td>', 'The colors are beautiful but the reflections are not strong enough for me.  Wonder what you could have done had you tried to capture the autumn leaves reflected in that blue-green table top . . . Voted earlier.', '2012-10-25 15:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
