(6891667, 1037933, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of a turtle - they always amaze me by how quickly they can get away when I''m trying to photograph them :)  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lovely shot of a turtle - they always amaze me by how quickly they can get away when I''m trying to photograph them :)  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-26 11:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
