(6893017, 1038445, 109227, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Love the detail, color and reflection.  Hope it does well for you. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Awesome!  Love the detail, color and reflection.  Hope it does well for you. (voted earlier)', '2012-10-28 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
