(6893045, 1038148, 100831, '<td valign="top">a wonderful topsy turvy whir of a blur.... but it''s way more than that... excellent composition and interesting subject... wow, what a great catch!</td>', 'a wonderful topsy turvy whir of a blur.... but it''s way more than that... excellent composition and interesting subject... wow, what a great catch!', '2012-10-28 21:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
