(6893068, 1037822, 67697, '<td valign="top">Some day you have to tell me how you get your cats to stick around the house like this.  Mine would be gone with an open door like that.  I love that you''ve also included the shot of possibly you and one of the kids in the background.  That seems to also fit in with the title.</td>', 'Some day you have to tell me how you get your cats to stick around the house like this.  Mine would be gone with an open door like that.  I love that you''ve also included the shot of possibly you and one of the kids in the background.  That seems to also fit in with the title.', '2012-10-28 22:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6893070, 1038389, 97225, '<td valign="top">The reversal turns it into a lovely painting.</td>', 'The reversal turns it into a lovely painting.', '2012-10-28 22:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6893072, 1038197, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great reflected scene.</td>', 'Great reflected scene.', '2012-10-28 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6893073, 1038432, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is overly processed with the contrast or dodge and burn but for some reason I really like it.  Your muted tones and strong contrast give the water a metallic look.  And the clouds look pretty cool.</td>', 'This is overly processed with the contrast or dodge and burn but for some reason I really like it.  Your muted tones and strong contrast give the water a metallic look.  And the clouds look pretty cool.', '2012-10-28 22:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6893074, 1038445, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! When I scroll down to just include the reflection it is perhaps even more so. 9</td>', 'Beautiful! When I scroll down to just include the reflection it is perhaps even more so. 9', '2012-10-28 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6893075, 1038492, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think I like busy city street shots like this because I live in such a small and ho hum town.  I get to live vicariously through scenes like this.  Love the bokeh dots.</td>', 'I think I like busy city street shots like this because I live in such a small and ho hum town.  I get to live vicariously through scenes like this.  Love the bokeh dots.', '2012-10-28 22:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
