(6893358, 1038391, 123751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiberius:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely found, beautifully captured, and you got a bling. <br/> <br/>Bravo! <br/> <br/>Unde e? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Multumesc !<br/>Este la podul Baneasa ... remember now :P?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-10-29 09:29:26.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Tiberius: Nicely found, beautifully captured, and you got a bling.  Bravo!  Unde e?   Multumesc !Este la podul Baneasa ... remember now :P?', '2012-10-29 08:16:38.000000', '2012-10-29 09:29:26.000000', 0),
(6893372, 1038455, 124815, '<td valign="top">The placement does not do justice to this shot. But it seldom does. Now, looking at the entire series I find it worth making a little booklet on kids moments and games.</td>', 'The placement does not do justice to this shot. But it seldom does. Now, looking at the entire series I find it worth making a little booklet on kids moments and games.', '2012-10-29 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893375, 1038207, 124815, '<td valign="top">I can feel your surprise in counting your shadows and reflections. A precious moment. So captivating!<br/> <br/>(I''ll give it a try with less grain on the wall and all the sharpness in the foreground and framed picture. Just a thought)</td>', 'I can feel your surprise in counting your shadows and reflections. A precious moment. So captivating! (I''ll give it a try with less grain on the wall and all the sharpness in the foreground and framed picture. Just a thought)', '2012-10-29 09:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893376, 1038406, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HCvE:</b></div><hr/><i> gave it a 6 because its well executed and a nice idea but not very interesting; in the end, what do we see, a shiny mic, it needs something extra... my 2c </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Look a little closer and you''ll see a reflection of a beautiful<br/>Art deco 1920s ball room, oh wait yes I forgot if it doesn''t smack the user in the face then it''s no good on dpc haha</td>', 'Originally posted by HCvE: gave it a 6 because its well executed and a nice idea but not very interesting; in the end, what do we see, a shiny mic, it needs something extra... my 2c   Look a little closer and you''ll see a reflection of a beautifulArt deco 1920s ball room, oh wait yes I forgot if it doesn''t smack the user in the face then it''s no good on dpc haha', '2012-10-29 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893379, 1037937, 124815, '<td valign="top">silly me! I thought it was a lucky capture. What do I know about right angles, strobes, CEP tonal contrast ....</td>', 'silly me! I thought it was a lucky capture. What do I know about right angles, strobes, CEP tonal contrast ....', '2012-10-29 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893388, 1038406, 49511, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, i see it now. Sorry my 6 should have been an 8.</td>', 'Oh yeah, i see it now. Sorry my 6 should have been an 8.', '2012-10-29 09:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893393, 1037808, 113278, '<td valign="top">Congrats, your control of light is superb.</td>', 'Congrats, your control of light is superb.', '2012-10-29 09:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893394, 1038094, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah I thought I recognised this place, as far as places go this was the prettiest, got to love those ones twos and threes hey...!!!</td>', 'Oh yeah I thought I recognised this place, as far as places go this was the prettiest, got to love those ones twos and threes hey...!!!', '2012-10-29 09:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893397, 1038152, 59029, '<td valign="top">Beautifully effective and such a simple but striking image.  Well done and congrats on the ribbon!! :-)</td>', 'Beautifully effective and such a simple but striking image.  Well done and congrats on the ribbon!! :-)', '2012-10-29 09:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6893400, 1038094, 66515, '<td valign="top">I love the scene and it has a lot of potential. As giantmike mentions the saturation has been pushed too far. I also see some haloing and strange blending (assuming this is HDR) in the trees. The being said I have no idea how to do a successful HDR with trees that go into bright areas (i.e. the sky). <br/> <br/>I really enjoy the composition and the subtle details in the sky.</td>', 'I love the scene and it has a lot of potential. As giantmike mentions the saturation has been pushed too far. I also see some haloing and strange blending (assuming this is HDR) in the trees. The being said I have no idea how to do a successful HDR with trees that go into bright areas (i.e. the sky).  I really enjoy the composition and the subtle details in the sky.', '2012-10-29 09:28:02.000000', NULL, 0);
