(6893944, 1038116, 135629, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> Devastated this didn''t ribbon. Creative! Met the challenge. Stupid voters didn''t appreciate reflections. Better title might have helped at the margin. Loved the shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have an image in another challenge right now that I believe is missed on a lot of folks, and a more obvious title probably would have made it very apparent. And to think just a few challenges ago I was getting blasted for having too crafty a title! haha oh well, I''m in it for the PICS! thanks for the comment though. One day I will 7.0 or ribbon.. one DAY.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: Devastated this didn''t ribbon. Creative! Met the challenge. Stupid voters didn''t appreciate reflections. Better title might have helped at the margin. Loved the shot.   I have an image in another challenge right now that I believe is missed on a lot of folks, and a more obvious title probably would have made it very apparent. And to think just a few challenges ago I was getting blasted for having too crafty a title! haha oh well, I''m in it for the PICS! thanks for the comment though. One day I will 7.0 or ribbon.. one DAY.', '2012-10-29 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 0),
