(7241658, 1038492, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ve been enjoying wandering through your portfolio this evening.  Even though I''ve seen many of the shots before, it''s still a pleasure to come back and revisit them.  This one is very "you" in many ways - it''s street, it''s blur, it''s mono, it involves the glass of a New York building, and it is really, really good.  Thanks for sharing your vision with us - it is very much appreciated.</td>', 'I''ve been enjoying wandering through your portfolio this evening.  Even though I''ve seen many of the shots before, it''s still a pleasure to come back and revisit them.  This one is very "you" in many ways - it''s street, it''s blur, it''s mono, it involves the glass of a New York building, and it is really, really good.  Thanks for sharing your vision with us - it is very much appreciated.', '2014-07-17 02:30:42.000000', NULL, 0);
